---
description: >-
  Flat (non-nested) smoke test for the v0.8 agentflow node shapes - input,
  tool, refdoc, decision, and action - all assigned via `@{ shape: ... }`
  on plain top-level nodes, without any flow containers or model metadata.
---
agentflow-beta TB
  city["City Input"]
  research["research_location"]
  brief["Research Brief"]
  style_ref["Nordic Design"]
  check["Quality OK?"]
  post["post_results"]

  city --> research --> brief
  research -.- style_ref
  brief --> check
  check -- yes --> post

  city@{ shape: input }
  research@{ shape: tool }
  style_ref@{ shape: refdoc }
  check@{ shape: decision }
  post@{ shape: action }
